#: includes/class-privacy.php:27
msgid ""
"Our popups store some technical information in your browser (localStorage "
"and sessionStorage) to avoid showing you the same message too often: the "
"date of the first visit, the number of pages viewed, the time of the last "
"activity on the site and, for each popup, when it was shown, closed or used."
" This information is not sent to us and does not identify you. You can "
"delete it by clearing your browser data."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:28
msgid ""
"If some popups are shown only to those who have (or have not) already filled"
" in one of our forms, the browser also remembers which forms were sent and "
"when, without the data entered."
msgstr ""

